          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गाड़ना (gāṛnā) is inherited from gaḍḍ, a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 3979): to drive something into the ground, a post or a treasure."
            }
          ]
        },
